/ActualText (Systems and Computer Engineering graduate. Proactive, eager to learn every day, a team player who adapts to the pace of work, responsible, and committed to achieving work goals. Extensive experience in web development and website administration. Proficient in software \(Microsoft Office, Microsoft SQL Server, TeamViewer, Rational Rose, FileZilla, Packet Tracer-Cisco, among others\). Knowledge of programming and layout languages \013\013for web development \(PHP, JavaScript, HTML, CSS\), frameworks \(Bootstrap and Materialize\), and content management systems \(WordPress\). Also experienced in desktop PC maintenance and repair.\n)
