/ActualText (PLAY Group Latam - Agencia de Marketing Digital \(Noviembre 2020 - Julio 2026\)\n\nI worked for this agency for approximately 5 years, and my experience there was very positive. I started as a Front End Developer for about 3 years. During that time, I intuitively learned to create web designs in Figma, for both desktop and mobile. These designs were then developed into code. \n\nI developed WordPress projects, including landing pages and websites, along with the admin panel. I worked on these projects independently, and this also included deploying them to the client's server. \n\nI participated in Laravel website projects, where my role was to create the visual design. I worked alongside the Back End team, who handled the admin panel and deployment. \n\nAfter this experience, I became the Software Area Leader, managing the various types of projects that came into the department, such as e-commerce projects, landing pages, websites with admin panels, bilingual websites, etc. The management of these projects involved direct contact with the client to understand their requirements, scope, and expectations, as well as team organization. I was also responsible for developing the project Gantt chart, estimating timelines with the team, and organizing pending tasks throughout the project's development. Together with the team, we reviewed the resources to be used, the project infrastructure, server proposals, and domain settings for the client. \nI have the knowledge and experience to develop diverse projects across various sectors. As part of my work, I have also participated in several projects as a programmer while simultaneously managing projects.)
/K [15]
/S /Span
/Type /StructElem
/P 814 0 R
/Pg 5 0 R
>>
