/ActualText (Innova Educa Tech Academy \(January 2019\)\nInstructor of courses in computer assembly \(theory/practice\), camera installation \(theory/practice\), software installation \(installation of basic computer programs, antivirus software, browsers, types of computer viruses, operating system knowledge\), and networking \(introduction, types of networks, network topology, exercises with IP addresses\).\nI developed a manageable website for the academy, meeting all the coordinator's requirements. WordPress was used for content management, along with Elementor.\n\nSeoMarketingPeru \(April 2016 \023 February 2017: 11 months\)\nI worked in web development, creating manageable websites for various companies in different sectors \(real estate, electronics sales, technology equipment stores, education, tourism, among others\), as well as creating custom websites for professionals. Responsible for meetings with companies to gather requirements for the website, and for managing and maintaining all web pages for Seomarketingperu. Also provided support to the design department by creating images and logos for new companies. Used software such as FileZilla to upload files to the websites, accessing the servers.\n\nUniversity of Sciences and Humanities \(August 2015 \023 November 2015: 4 months\)\nProvided support in the Systems department for the administration and maintenance of the University of Sciences and Humanities website, responsible for creating sections for cultural events, sporting events, conferences, among others.)
