/ActualText (In Information Technology and Office\nOffice Course: Microsoft Word, offered by Instituto SISE.\nOffice Course: Basic Microsoft Excel, offered by Instituto SISE.\nOffice Course: Microsoft PowerPoint, offered by Instituto SISE.\nComputer Tools Course: Microsoft Word, Microsoft Excel \(Basic and Intermediate\), Microsoft PowerPoint, offered by the Continuing Education Center of the University of Sciences and Humanities.\nProgramming Language Course: PHP \(Basic and Intermediate\), offered by Centro Inform\341tico Sistemas Un\355.\n\nIn Foreign Languages\nComplete Basic English Language Program, offered by the Peruvian-British Cultural Association \(Brit\341nico\).\nComplete Intermediate English Language Program, offered by the Peruvian-British Cultural Association \(Brit\341nico\).\n\nAdditional Courses\nSpecialization Diploma in Project Management, offered by the UNI Diploma Programs Department.\nProject Management Course under the PMI approach.)
